  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/c3f357ea-f6de-48fe-a9cd-67cb7f4bb523-1.jpg\" style=\"width: 201px; height: 210px;\" /></p><p>Let angle of incidence be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#952;</mi></math>, then angle of refraction&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>. From Snell&#39;s law, we can write,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msqrt><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfrac><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msqrt><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><msqrt><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msqrt></mfenced></math></p>",
